<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport while Somali intelligence killed nine al-Shabaab members in Middle Shabelle, and U.S. airstrikes hit al-Shabaab positions near Kismayo after a probing attack on Mangai Camp in Lamu. The Somali president accused the United Arab Emirates of funding armed groups, ordered the UAE ambassador to leave and recalled Somalia's envoy from Abu Dhabi, prompting a UAE condemnation. A Somali American Uber driver was assaulted following political rhetoric, leading to a community rally for the victim's family. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPS0haTVlfaWhERG9aS3VqX1RVeldBa05MalhGa1dUazZLSzVtOGRQOXlzcER5ZXZjbVJWWG1TNzYzajJMX2IweHFzWVNFTk1CTjJsNzdCb0xzY2VORnk0UTZESW1iVGY4Sm8yZmlZbzlERjVZOXFzUU0zZHFyLTdqbUlfaHpLSjZ1ZVRJVzVvQWxXU3NZdmJNdkVyWmtKWWhtR0toT1Jn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNdTVINEY4c0hEdjd0ODR4a2xVX0dJUUZScTltNXIxZEJRSDdfNHdZN1VDM0t6blpQajFnWHdPdjJadXQzRmJnTmhxczR2eXltMXRaUHFWSUI0ZkdHYkJfRnZGaFE2SVlhcFhyc1FwYzZhTmhjN3FzQldXa1AwZ0VIM05LWHVBTG9UY3BrNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOYm9mR0hrZl8tOWNmQ250SzNQVzlkYjl3dkFVYnlEV0xMaFlOQ3lzZDkwc2M0S1NsT1RQZEx4ZXQ2bUF0Si1fZkplbUdUYm94cmhYeC0yb0VkVmxRYl